  "recordType": "rule-part",
  "ruleText": "PART He-W 574 NON-EMERGENCY MEDICAL TRANSPORTATION\n\nREVISION NOTE:\n\nDocument #14393, effective 10-1-25, made extensive changes to the wording and numbering of part He-W 547 Non-Emergency Medical Transportation. Document #14393 repealed content, including removing the definitions for “commissioner”, “general medical transportation”, “out of area”, “point of origin”, “recipient driver”, and “volunteer”, and also repealed former section He-W 574.09 Extenuating Circumstances.",
